{"title":"Desert Wolf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 25 Desert Wolf that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: packDamagePerAlly: .1</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/wolf-sinew\">Wolf Sinew</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>32</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf?lv=26\">Lv 26 <span>23</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>3</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Scorpion%20Pits\">Scorpion Pits</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf?lv=25\" title=\"Pick level 25\"><td><b>25</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td>32</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>26</b></td><td>94</td><td>18.8</td><td>1,300</td><td class=\"muted\">282 · 26.3 · 3,900</td><td>23</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"desert-wolf\" data-map-level=\"26\">Show level 26 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"jackal-pelt\" title=\"Jackal Pelt - in 100% of 2 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 6 total, 2–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a527c3adeb957a426463.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Jackal Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 2/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link quest\" data-item=\"sunbleached-fang\" title=\"Sunbleached Fang - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 8 total, 8 per drop - Quest item: Goats on the Rock\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/87ff80ab6feed9f385f8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"quest-tag\" title=\"Quest item\">Q</span><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sunbleached Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wolf-meat\" title=\"Wolf Meat - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3754737ea3fb2fec593a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolfpelt-torso\" title=\"Werewolfpelt Torso - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a1901275f30658477144.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolfpelt Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-423.1px,-725.7px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/0/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:512px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/0/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:512px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/2/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:512px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/2/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:768px\"><i style=\"left:426.4px;top:760.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:479.2px;top:765.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:464.2px;top:727.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:509.5px;top:752.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:339.7px;top:688.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:368.8px;top:692.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:335.7px;top:675.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:351.9px;top:699.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:366.1px;top:698.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:363.4px;top:696.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:424.3px;top:696.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:421.6px;top:698.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:399.3px;top:681.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:362.7px;top:714.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:367.5px;top:713.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:423.6px;top:712.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:445.3px;top:705.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:386.4px;top:703.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:405.4px;top:720.6px\"></i><i st